<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>This is temporary, it will go into the engine at some point
</p><p>Check the use conditions for the ability, e.g. melee only
</p><p>Later this should be done mostly in the UI (e.g. don't even allow to use it)
</p>
